    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present no. 24 Cherryfield Close to the market. This is a four bedroom dormer bungalow ideally located within this mature and established development. \n\nOffering light-filled living space throughout, the accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, guest wc, living room, kitchen/dining room, four bedrooms (two up two down) and family bathroom. \n\nTo the rear you have a private, west-facing garden independently accessed by a side passage. To the front is a concrete driveway providing off-street parking with additional parking at the front of the property.\n\nCherryfield Close is a mature and sought after residential development, easily accessible to many amenities, such as well serviced high frequency bus routes, good transport links; N3/M3/M50 providing direct access to the Airport / City Centre and national road network), Connolly Hospital, excellent schools and recreational facilities. It is also within walking distance of the Blanchardstown Shopping Centre. The Phoenix Park is only a 15 minute drive away and Clonsilla Train Station is easily accessible with connections to both the Luas and DART. \n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.27m x 3.50m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.58m x 3.48m\n\n\nGuest WC - 1.40m x 0.87m\n\n\nBedroom 1 (downstairs) - 3.15m x 2.76m\n\n\nBedroom 2 (downstairs) - 2.74m x 2.76m\n\n\nBedroom 3 (upstairs) - 4.05m x 3.45m\n\n\nBedroom 4 (upstairs) - 3.45m x 2.67m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.94m x 1.78m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Unencumbered Sale</li><li> Blank Canvas</li><li> Ready for immediate occupancy</li><li> Four bed semi-detached c 90sqm / 968sqft</li><li> Recently painted</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> West facing rear garden</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Quiet enclave</li><li> Easy access to N3/M3/M50</ul>"
      },
